      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استتكّ التِّكَّةَ</span></b> , (IDrd, K,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِالتِّكَّةِ</span>, (Msb,)
<i>He inserted the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تِكَّة</span> <i>in</i> [<i>the double upper border
of</i>] <i>the drawers,</i> or <i>trousers.</i> (IDrd, Msb, K.)
You say also, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ يَسْتَتِكُ بِالحَرِيرِ</span> <i>He makes use of
a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تِكَّة</span> <i>of silk.</i> (A.)

